#. [scenario]: id=01_Defend_the_Forest
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:13
msgid "Defend the Forest"
msgstr "保衛森林"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:26
msgid ""
"The arrival of humans and orcs caused turmoil among the nations of the Great Continent. Elves, previously in uneasy balance with dwarves and others, had for centuries fought nothing more than an occasional skirmish. They were to find themselves facing conflicts of a long-forgotten intensity."
msgstr ""
"人類與半獸人的到來引起“大陸“陣巨大的漣漪。 在此之前精靈、矮人和其它種族間維持著脆弱的平衡，幾世紀以來只發生零星的衝突。他們即將面對的是被長久遺忘的激烈紛爭。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:30
msgid ""
"Their first encounter with the newcomers went less well than either side might have wished."
msgstr "與入侵者第一次的接觸並不像雙方想像的如此順利。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:34
msgid ""
"But humans, though crude and brash, at least had in them a creative spark which elves could recognize as akin to their own nature. Orcs seemed completely alien."
msgstr ""
"雖然說人類既無禮又自大，但是至少精靈認為他們擁有一些富有創意的想法跟自己這方面是很像的。 至於半獸人..精靈完全找不到雙方的共通點;半獸人之於精靈就像是來自外星生物一樣。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:38
msgid ""
"For some years after Haldric’s people landed, orcs remained scarce more than a rumor to trouble the green fastnesses of the elves. That remained so until the day that an elvish noble of ancient line, Erlornas by name, faced an enemy unlike any he had ever met before."
msgstr ""
"在海德瑞克的人民到來的多年以後，半獸人不過就像一個騷擾精靈綠色大地的謠言一般的存在。 直到有一天，一位名叫爾嶁那思的古老精靈貴族臨著前所未見的敵人.."

#. [part]
#. "northern marches" is *not* a typo for "northern marshes" here.
#. In archaic English, "march" means "border country".
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:44
msgid ""
"The orcs were first sighted from the north marches of the great forest of Wesmere."
msgstr "精靈最早發現的半獸人是在韋斯彌爾大森林的北方邊界。"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Urugha
#. [side]: type=Orcish Slayer, id=Gharlsa
#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Gnargha
#. [side]: type={TYPE}
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:69
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:77
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:59
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:77
msgid "Orcs"
msgstr "半獸人"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Urugha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:74
msgid "Urugha"
msgstr "尤陸卡"

#. [unit]: type=Elvish Rider, id=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:94
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:387
msgid "Lomarfel"
msgstr "羅摩福"

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:112
msgid ""
"My lord! A party of aliens has made camp to the north and lays waste to the forest. Our scouts believe it’s a band of orcs."
msgstr "閣下！ 在北方的森林裡有一群來路不明的外地人在那裡扎營而且也留下了許多穢物。 我們的偵察員相信這是一群半獸人所為。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:116
msgid ""
"Orcs? It seems unlikely. The human king, Haldric, crushed them when they landed on these shores, and since then they’ve been no more than a bogey mothers use to scare the children."
msgstr "半獸人?  看起來不太可能吧。人類的國王海德瑞克，早在以前他們登陸時給予他們迎頭痛擊，自此半獸人只被母親用來嚇唬不聽話的小孩而已。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:120
msgid ""
"So it seemed, my lord. Yet there is a band of them in the north cutting down healthy trees by the dozen, and making great fires from the wood. They trample the greensward into mud and do not even bury their foul dung. I believe I can smell the stench even here."
msgstr ""
"閣下，看似如此沒錯。 但是在北方的樹林裡有一群半獸人在砍伐大量健康的樹木，用來生巨大的火。 他們行過的草原被踐踏成泥地他們甚至於連排泄物都不處理。 我從這裡就感覺到臭氣薰天。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:124
msgid ""
"So the grim tales of them prove true. They must not be allowed to continue; we must banish this blight from our forests. I shall marshal the wardens and drive them off. And the Council needs to hear of this; take the message and return with reinforcements, for there might be more of them."
msgstr ""
"如此說來那些恐怖的傳言都是真的。不能讓他們繼續放肆下去，我們必須把這些害蟲趕出我們的森林。我得招集衛兵來攆走他們。同時我們得通報議政廳，把信息送過去並且帶援軍回來，這裡應該會有更多的半獸人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:128
msgid "Yes, my lord!"
msgstr "是的，閣下！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:146
msgid "Defeat Urugha"
msgstr "擊敗尤陸卡"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:150
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:214
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:349
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:180
msgid "Death of Erlornas"
msgstr "爾嶁那思之死"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:160
msgid ""
"Elves can move quickly and safely among the trees. Pick off the enemy grunts with your archers from the safety of the forest."
msgstr "精靈在樹林裡可以迅速又安全的移動。 從的隱僻森林裡用弓箭手阻擊敵方的蠻兵。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:173
msgid ""
"Look at them. Big, slow, clumsy and hardly a bow in hand. Keep to the trees, use your arrows and the day will be ours."
msgstr "看看他們。 龐大、緩慢又笨手笨腳的，連手上拿著一把弓的都少有。 以樹木作為掩護，善用手中的弓與箭，勝利將會是屬於我們的。"

#. [message]: race=elf
#. the player hasn't recruited any Shamans. This message isn't shown if they have a Shaman, even if she has 0 xp.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:222
msgid ""
"My lord, none of our healers have experience on the battlefield. It pleases me that they are safe, but if we should embark on a campaign then we will surely need them alongside us in the battles ahead."
msgstr "閣下，我們的治癒師都沒有實戰經驗。欣慰的是他們現在是安全的，但如果我們將有一場戰役要打，那就一定需要他們與我們一起並肩作戰。"

#. [message]: race=elf
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:223
msgid ""
"female^My lord, none of our healers have experience on the battlefield. It pleases me that they are safe, but if we should embark on a campaign then we will surely need them alongside us in the battles ahead."
msgstr "閣下，我們的治癒師都沒有實戰經驗。欣慰的是他們現在是安全的，但如果我們將有一場戰役要打，那就一定需要他們與我們一起並肩作戰。"

#. [message]: race=elf
#. the player has recruited some Shamans but has lost all them (or managed to level a Sorceress)
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:237
msgid ""
"My lord, none of our surviving healers have experience on the battlefield. It pains me to suggest that we should risk another, but if we should embark on a campaign then we will surely need them alongside us in the battles ahead."
msgstr "閣下，我們倖存的治癒師都沒有實戰經驗。沉重地建議我們應該要冒點風險，但如果我們將有一場戰役要打，那就一定需要他們與我們一起並肩作戰。"

#. [message]: race=elf
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:238
msgid ""
"female^My lord, none of our surviving healers have experience on the battlefield. It pains me to suggest that we should risk another, but if we should embark on a campaign then we will surely need them alongside us in the battles ahead."
msgstr "閣下，我們倖存的治癒師都沒有實戰經驗。沉重地建議我們應該要冒點風險，但如果我們將有一場戰役要打，那就一定需要他們與我們一起並肩作戰。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:269
msgid ""
"I’ve been bested, but the combat wasn’t fair... A thousand curses on you, withered coward! May you suffer... and when my master, Rualsha, finds you may he wipe your people from the face of this earth!"
msgstr ""
"我雖然戰敗了。但這場戰鬥打從一開始就不公平... 你這個懦弱的傢伙，我詛咒你招到神明的逞罰！你會受盡苦難...當我的主人盧拉夏找到你的那一刻，也就是你與你的同胞告別這個世界的時刻！"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:276
msgid ""
"Rualsha? Hmm... What if... Assemble a war-party, we need to scout north!"
msgstr "盧拉夏? 恩... 如此說來... 招集一個軍團，我們繼續向北方偵查！"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#. role=advisor will always be a male unit of the Elvish Scout line.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:296
msgid "It’s hopeless; we’ve tried everything, and they’re still coming back."
msgstr "完了，沒望了。我們用盡一切辦法他們還是一直推回來。"

#. [message]: speaker=Urugha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:300
msgid ""
"Forward, you worthless worms! Look at them, they’re tired and afraid! You killed their will to fight, now go and finish the job!"
msgstr "上前衝，你們這些沒用的東西！ 你看他們又累又怕！ 他們戰鬥的意志被擊潰了，上吧！把他們一網打盡！"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:304
msgid ""
"That cloud of dust on the horizon... flee! There’s more of the abominations heading this way! Fall back before we’re outnumbered and crushed."
msgstr "看遠方地平線塵土飛揚的... 先向後撤！ 更多令人作噁的傢伙向咱們這個邊衝過來了！ 在我們以寡擊眾之前先撤退。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:309
msgid ""
"Lord Erlornas didn’t drive the orcs back, although he and his warriors tried their absolute best. When another war band arrived, elvish resistance crumbled."
msgstr "爾嶁那思領主與他的勇士們儘管用盡了辦法也無法擊退這群半獸人們。 當又一個半獸人軍團的到來， 精靈的抵抗徹徹底底的被瓦解了。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/01_Defend_the_Forest.cfg:314
msgid ""
"Of the ensuing events little is known, since much was lost in the chaos and confusion, but one thing is painfully sure. Elves lost the campaign."
msgstr "接下來的發展如何知道的人少之又少，因為很多東西都在戰亂中遺失了，但是唯一可以確定的是精靈輸了這場戰役。"

#. [scenario]: id=02_Wasteland
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:23
msgid "Wasteland"
msgstr "荒蕪大地"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:38
msgid ""
"The path of the orcish war band was easy to follow — a wide swathe of trampled ground through violated forest. Erlornas and his party swiftly followed it north and west."
msgstr "半獸人軍團的動向是很好追蹤的——在森林裡面只要看到一條被蹂躪的痕跡那就是他們行軍的方向。爾嶁那思與他的小隊迅速的向西北方一路追蹤。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:42
msgid ""
"As they fared further north the green forest thinned around them, slowly fading into a barren and fallow country. The signs were obvious and unmistakable — tree stumps, an occasional half-rotten tree felled long ago, and dead wood around them in scarce grass. This had been forest once, like the woods they called home. It had been murdered."
msgstr ""
"當他們越往北走周遭從生意盎然的森林慢慢轉變成荒蕪貧瘠的大地。 這些種種跡象——斷根殘支以及因腐爛而倒的樹木散落在一片青黃不濟的草地上——很明顯的這裡如他們家鄉一般，曾經是座森林，但是現在卻是一片狼藉。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:46
msgid ""
"There was no trail to be found here; wind and rain had erased the spoor. Fortunately, there was no need of a trail; smoke on the horizon betrayed the presence of their enemies."
msgstr "足跡到這裡就不見了，風和雨水把他們的蹤跡都抹去了。幸運地，在地平線那端冉冉升起的煙火暴露了敵人們的蹤跡。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:50
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Erlornas was near-certain they would find orcs there. No clan of dwarves would break their ancient treaties with the elves in this way; humans were never so... methodical in their destruction, and did not travel in sufficiently large numbers in a north country they found too cold and damp for comfort. The great question remained — would he find Rualsha?"
msgid ""
"Erlornas was near-certain they would find orcs there. No clan of dwarves would break their ancient treaties with the elves in this way; humans were never so...methodical in their destruction, and did not travel in sufficiently large numbers in a north country they found too cold and damp for comfort. The great question remained — would he find Rualsha?"
msgstr ""
"爾嶁那思越來越篤定那裡一定有半獸人。矮人氏族不會以這種方式撕毀他們與精靈之間的古老契約；人類們嘛...不會有系統進行破壞，而且也不會一大群人長途跋涉到他們不習慣的寒北之地。 到底最終，他能找到盧拉夏嗎？"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:54
msgid ""
"Perhaps, but not here. The tribe this camp housed was too small to impress fear on other orcs. Come next morning, the elves were prepared for battle."
msgstr "也許吧，但肯定不是在這。在這個部落駐紮的人數太少，不足以令其它半獸人部落感到畏懼。 翌日，精靈們處於備戰狀態。"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Slayer, id=Gharlsa
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:82
msgid "Gharlsa"
msgstr "格勒紗"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Krughnar
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:108
msgid "Rival Orcs"
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Krughnar
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:113
msgid "Krughnar"
msgstr "格拉爾"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:174
msgid "The trail leads straight to this place, my lord."
msgstr "閣下，半獸人們的蹤跡指向這個地方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:178
msgid ""
"There is a keep ahead of us. How comes it that we know nothing of it? I thought our borders were watched more carefully."
msgstr "前方有座堡壘。 為什麼我們不知道有關於此座堡壘存在的訊息？我以為我們的邊防任務執行的很仔細。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:182
msgid ""
"I... I know not, my lord. For ages there was no one in these lands that could build such a thing save us. I fear we have fallen prey a false sense of security that has injured the vigilance of our scouts."
msgstr ""
"閣下...我...我不是很清楚。一直以來，除了我們之外沒有人能夠在這片土地上建造出像樣的堡壘。 長期的和平給我們虛假的安全感，使得我們的偵查部隊日漸掉以輕心。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:186
msgid "When the fighting ends, I’ll have some answers. But for now—"
msgstr "當戰鬥結束時我會得到答案。 至於現在..."

#. [message]: speaker=Gharlsa
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:190
msgid "Gharlsa sees elves... yes... Fresh meat for wolves. Yes, yes..."
msgstr "格勒紗看到了精靈...沒錯...適合當狼飼料。 太好了，太好了..."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:194
msgid "— let’s focus on the task at hand."
msgstr "...先不多說了，讓我們集中注意力於眼前的任務。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:198
msgid "Does that demented creature truly believe he can kill us?"
msgstr "這個頭腦有問題的傢伙以為他殺得了我們？"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:202
msgid "Appearances can be deceiving. Tell the men to be cautious."
msgstr "不可以貌取人，外表是可以欺騙一切的。 把話傳下去，叫弟兄們提高警覺。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:210
msgid "Defeat Gharlsa"
msgstr "擊敗格勒紗"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:224
msgid ""
"Assassins are hard to hit, and their poison is insidious. Stay close to the villages, where poisoning can be cured, and force your enemies to attack you from the river."
msgstr "刺客是很難擊中的，同時也得提防他們下毒。 盡量離村莊近一點，在那裡中毒的單位會痊癒的，同時迫使敵人從河裡進攻。"

#. [message]: speaker=Krughnar
#. Krughnar is a follower of Lich-Lord Selmar. He calls the other orcs traitors because they've rebelled, and follow Rualsha instead. The player doesn't know this yet.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:310
msgid ""
"I have caught you at last, traitorous Gharlsa! May your spirit suffer greatly for your weakness!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Gharlsa
#. Gharlsa is a follower of Rualsha, another orc - not the Lich-Lord Selmar that Krughnar follows. The player doesn't know this yet.
#. "orcs only obey orcs" is also a similar theme to what Rualsha says in the final scenario
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:316
msgid ""
"Traitor? No... you betray. Gharlsa only obey orcs. Rualsha great orc. Yes, yes... Rualsha true leader."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Krughnar
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:320
msgid ""
"Rise up, grunts! We have a great fight upon us! Let your rage flow freely! Let your blades slay all! First one to draw blood will feast by my fire this night!"
msgstr "士兵們，準備好！眼前是一場大戰！ 讓你們的憤怒化為力量！ 讓你們的利刃無法敵擋！ 讓敵人流出第一滴血的人將會在慶功宴上與我共飲！"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:333
msgid ""
"It seems this “Rualsha’s” leadership does not stand uncontested. The orcs have turned their attention from us to their rival. The two camps mean to destroy each other, and much of our forest in the process."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:337
msgid ""
"Aim true, men, with wit and courage the day will be ours. And spare no-one, there can be no orc south of the hills, else we’ll never have peace again."
msgstr "弟兄們，瞄準好。使出你們的渾身解數，勝利將會是屬於我們的。記住，一個都別放過。 在這山丘以南一個半獸人都不許存活，否則和平永遠不會到來。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:345
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Defeat all enemy leaders"
msgid "Defeat both enemy leaders"
msgstr "擊敗所有敵人指揮官"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:359
msgid ""
"Your enemies are focused on each other. Gather gold and build your army while they exhaust their armies, then move in and finish them off."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Gharlsa
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:379
msgid "Yes... yes... Slay them!"
msgstr "好啊...好啊...殺光他們！"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:396
msgid "Hurts... failed... Rualsha gonna be angry..."
msgstr "痛...敗了...盧拉夏會生氣的..."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:412
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "You won... elf... But it changes... nothing... (<i>cough</i>)"
msgid "You won... Elf... But it changes... Nothing... (*cough*)"
msgstr "精靈... 你贏... 但改不...任何...（<i>咳咳</i>）"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:416
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "We found the way... Now... we will come in numbers... (<i>cough</i>) you can’t imagine..."
msgid ""
"We found the way... Now... We will come in numbers... (*cough*) You can’t imagine..."
msgstr "我們找到方法... 很快... 我們將蜂擁...（<i>咳咳</i>）你無法想像..."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:420
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "(<i>Cough</i>) I’ll be waiting... among the dead..."
msgid "(*cough*) I’ll be waiting... Among the dead..."
msgstr "（咳咳）我在黃泉路...等你..."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:452
msgid ""
"The orcish chieftain finally fell, overcome by his wounds. The elves found themselves in a half-ruined camp littered with the bodies of both sides, there was no hale orc in sight, nor did any of the wounded beg mercy. The elves took no prisoners."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:461
msgid ""
"It’s done, lord. No-one escaped. No-one tried to escape. I’m... disturbed."
msgstr "結束了，閣下。半獸人們無人倖免。對這個結果我感到...不安。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:465
msgid ""
"Good. But their disregard for self-preservation is astounding. As is their ferocity when defending what they claim as their own. Have the scouts found others this side of the hills?"
msgstr ""
"很好。 但話說回來他們奮不顧身的精神的確是勇氣可嘉。 那股蠻勁就像他們保護他們宣稱擁有的東西一樣頑強。 偵查兵有在山丘的另一頭發現其他的敵人嗎？"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:469
msgid ""
"No, lord. But trolls were spotted in the hills ahead. Do we really need to cross them to the north?"
msgstr "啟稟大人，並沒發現。反倒是發現在前面的山丘上有巨魔。我們去北方一定要穿過他們嗎？"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:473
msgid ""
"Yes. The council has spoken to me through a dream-sending. They are troubled. Reinforcements have been sent after us, but we need to press on. Tell the men to rest, we’ll move out at dawn."
msgstr "沒錯。 之前議會有托夢予我。 他們很擔心。 援兵已經出發了，但是我們沒時間等待他們的到來。 傳令下去給弟兄們休息一下。 我們凌晨破曉時出發。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:491
msgid "We can’t carry on, lord, the men are too tired. We have to fall back."
msgstr "閣下，我們負荷不了了，弟兄們都很累了。 我們得後退。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:495
msgid ""
"Damn it. Sound the retreat, we’ll try again when reinforcements arrive."
msgstr "該死。 鳴金收兵。 我們等援軍到達時再進攻。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/02_Wasteland.cfg:500
msgid ""
"The expected relief caught up with them a few days later. The following morning they took the field against a far larger host of orcs. The battle ended in a draw; the war raged on for years..."
msgstr "幾天之後援軍終於抵達。 第二天一早他們便和更大群的半獸人部落於原野上開戰。這場戰鬥以最後和局收場，但整個戰爭卻延續了數年之久..."

#. [scenario]: id=03_Valley_of_Trolls
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:22
msgid "Valley of Trolls"
msgstr "巨魔峽谷"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:36
msgid ""
"Next morning, the elves set off again, increasingly wearied by the hardships of the campaign and longing for the green comfort of their home forests. This land was barren and rugged; nothing shielded them from biting northern wind as they traveled towards the mountains looming before them."
msgstr ""
"翌日，拖著因戰鬥而身心俱疲的軀殼並帶著對綠意盎然的森林的思鄉情緒，精靈們再度出發了。 地勢崎嶇不平且荒涼，故精靈們前往朦朧的山脈時沒有任何的東西可以遮掩北方吹來的寒風。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:40
msgid ""
"At dusk they arrived at the mouth of a valley cutting almost straight through the range and made camp, as scouts warned that the area was hostile and the road ahead treacherous in darkness. There were no songs or music that night and most of the elves slept uneasily. An unlucky few kept a cautious watch."
msgstr ""
"在傍晚時分，精靈們抵達了峽谷的入口，並在那裡紮營。 據斥候回報這個地區充滿敵意而且前方的路陰森不定。那天晚上，沒有音樂和歌聲相伴，使得精靈們輾轉難眠。有幾個倒楣的還得在這個環境下守夜。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:44
msgid ""
"When sunrise came, the elves moved into battle formations. Whatever waited in the slopes ahead, it would not find them unprepared."
msgstr "當旭日東升時，精靈們已經擺出陣形，準備就位了。 不論前方是什麼在等待他們的到來，都會發現精靈們是有備而來的。"

#. [side]: type={TYPE}
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:68
msgid "Trolls"
msgstr "巨魔"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:135
msgid ""
"We are far from our lands, now, Erlornas, and we have driven the orcs from the forest. Why do we not return home?"
msgstr "爾嶁那思，我們現在已經離我們的領土很遠了，而且我們也把半獸人從森林擊退了。為什麼我們還不能回家呢？"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:139
msgid ""
"You know well enough... Rualsha. That name sounds everywhere we go since the incursion began. That orc is much more than a mere marauding bandit in search of pillage. And he wants this land. <i>Our</i> land. He is planning an invasion, I’m sure of it. We must gather more information about his plans before we go back."
msgstr ""
"我想你心中已有答案...盧拉夏。打從第一天戰爭起這個名子一直縈繞在我們耳邊。這個傢伙並不簡單...他不只是一個到處打家劫舍的強盜。他想要的是這片土地。 <i>我們<i>的土地。我敢肯定，他現在一定在策劃一場入侵行動。在我們回去之前我們必須收集更多的情報。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:143
msgid "And tell me... How did you sleep last night?"
msgstr "順便告訴我... 你昨晚睡得好不好？"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:147
msgid ""
"How did I?... Uneasy, lord. My dreams were bleak, some of them nightmares."
msgstr "我睡得好不好？... 很不安，領主。 我作了很多很黑暗的惡夢。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:151
msgid ""
"Yes. The earth currents are perturbed here, and the bridges to the dreamland are tainted. I think there is a mage dwelling somewhere nearby. Or perhaps more than one; the traces are mixed, and some of them have an unwholesome flavor."
msgstr ""
"是的。 這裡的動盪不堪的地面玷污了通往夢鄉的橋樑。 我想這裡一定有一個法師的住在附近。 有可能不只一個;跡象不是很明顯，也有點混濁，有些味道還不是很好受。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:155
msgid ""
"It would be dire indeed for us if these orcs have magic to add to their battle-might."
msgstr "如果這群半獸人使用法術增強戰鬥力的話形勢將會對我方不利。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:159
msgid "We must discover if this is so."
msgstr "我們得趕緊調查出來。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:163
msgid ""
"Information will do us no good if we are killed before we return with it! These mountains look like troll territory."
msgstr "如果我們在回傳情報前被殺了，就等於前功盡棄！ 這些山脈看來是巨魔的地盤。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:167
msgid "Enough. The sun’s fully over the horizon. Give the order to advance."
msgstr "可以了。 太陽已升過地平線了。 傳達指令全軍開拔。 "

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:176
msgid "Move Erlornas to the west edge of the map"
msgstr ""

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:190
msgid ""
"Trolls are poor fighters when not on rugged terrain and fare even worse during the daytime. Lure them out of the hills and attack in the sunlight."
msgstr ""
"巨魔只有在崎嶇不平的地形上才能發揮，在其餘的地形他們是很弱的戰士。 尤其是白天，他們的戰鬥能力更糟。 把他們從山丘裡引出來在陽光之下攻擊他們。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:207
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:257
msgid "Dis not over! Rualsha gonna make you pay!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:211
msgid ""
"The chieftain blocking the pass is slain, lord. The way forward is clear."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:244
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "It is well. Break camp and move everyone through the pass before they rally. We’ll rest a bit on the other side; we have earned it."
msgid ""
"I have fought my way through. Break camp and move everyone through the pass before they rally. We’ll rest a bit on the other side; we have earned it."
msgstr "很好，拔營，在敵人重新集結前穿越前方的小徑。我們將在另一邊稍做休息，這是我們辛苦換來的。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:248
msgid "At once. How much time do you think we have?"
msgstr "馬上處理。您覺得我們還有多少時間？ "

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:252
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "A day, perhaps. We fought two clans today; they won’t take long to rally. We need to be gone from here by sunset next."
msgid ""
"A day, perhaps. We fought three clans today; they won’t take long to rally. We need to be gone from here by sunset next."
msgstr "大概一天吧。 我們今天一共打了兩個氏族，不要多久就會重整旗鼓，我們須在日落之前離開這裡。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:274
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "We can’t get through, my Lord. These whelps are not individually very dangerous, but there are huge numbers of them."
msgid ""
"We can’t get through, my lord. These whelps are not individually very dangerous, but there are huge numbers of them."
msgstr "閣下，我們無法通過。這些小傢伙單個來說沒什麼危險性，但是他們的數量非常龐大。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:278
msgid ""
"Four days of combat and nothing to show for it. How does it feel to you?"
msgstr "四天的仗打下來什麼結果也沒有。 你的看法如何？"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:282
msgid ""
"Terrible, my lord. Never in my life did I dream I’d be bested by mere trolls. What are your orders?"
msgstr "回閣下，非常槽。 我從來做夢都沒想到我會被巨魔給擊敗。您有什麼命令要傳達嗎？"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:286
msgid ""
"Withdraw and make camp a safe distance from the hills. There is no further point in this fight. We’ll wait for reinforcements."
msgstr "先撤退到離山丘，在一段安全距離外重新紮營。現在沒有再打下去的意義了，我們在營地等待增援。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:291
msgid ""
"The reinforcements arrived a few days later, a crack force of rangers with some cavalry support. When they attempted the pass again, they found not trolls but something worse — an orcish army approaching from the north."
msgstr "一群由遊俠勁旅與騎兵支援組成的援軍在幾日後抵達。當精靈們再度嘗試通過時，他們遇見比巨魔更槽的敵人——自北而下的半獸人軍團。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/03_Valley_of_Trolls.cfg:296
msgid ""
"The battle that ensued was bloody and inconclusive, and the elven losses were only the beginning of the mournful toll in a war that would rage for many years after."
msgstr "戰鬥十分血腥且無決定性的結果。而精靈的損失預告了往後令人悲痛的消耗戰的序幕，戰火延續數年之久。"

#. [scenario]: id=04_Linaera_the_Quick
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:13
msgid "Linaera the Quick"
msgstr "迅捷的萊鈉艾爾"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:27
msgid ""
"After a day of hard-earned rest the elves marched north again. This was unknown country, not frequented even by Wesmere’s furthermost-faring scouts."
msgstr "辛苦換來的一天休息結束後，精靈們繼續向北行軍。這是一個未知的原野，既使是尉斯米爾派往最北邊的斥候都很少來過。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:31
msgid ""
"Two days’ travel later, the forward scouts reported another orcish warband laying siege to a tower."
msgstr "在行軍兩天之後，前方的偵查回報說又一隻半獸人軍團正在包圍一座高塔。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:35
msgid ""
"Erlornas surveyed the siege from atop a small tree-covered hill overlooking the tower valley..."
msgstr "爾嶁那思從一座被樹林覆蓋的山丘上瞭望這座被半獸人包圍的塔..."

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Gnargha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:64
msgid "Gnargha"
msgstr "剛爾哈"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:98
msgid "Mages"
msgstr "法師"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:167
msgid "Report."
msgstr "報告。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:173
msgid ""
"A warband of orcs, no women or children among them, besieges a tower. It’s of human design... but we are far from the lands granted to humans by treaty, my lord Erlornas."
msgstr "一支半獸人軍團，沒有攜帶婦孺。他們包圍著一座塔。人類設計的...但是爾嶁那思閣下...這裡離條約上劃給人類居住地很遠。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:177
msgid ""
"Under the letter of the treaty, it is so. But this country is too cold and barren for us. I wonder, what manner of human would choose to live here, far from its kind? Hmmm..."
msgstr "條約上的確是如此記載。 但這地方對我們來說又冷又荒涼。我很好奇，是什麼樣的人類，遠離同類，居住在此呢？嗯..."

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:181
msgid "It trespasses, and should be driven out!"
msgstr "這是一個侵入的行為，應該把他們趕出去的！"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:185
msgid ""
"Hold. It is only one human, or a few of them at most. Time enough to speak of driving it out when we have no enemies in common."
msgstr "等等。 只是一個人類，最多不會超過幾個。 在搞清楚我們有沒有共通的敵人之前先不要輕舉望動。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:189
msgid ""
"Tell me: I see no bridge over the chasm around that keep. Is there any sign that one has been withdrawn by the defenders?"
msgstr "告訴我這是怎麼一回事？ 連一座跨越峽谷的橋都沒有。 有任何跡象顯示橋被守方收起來了嗎？"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:193
msgid ""
"No, lord. No traces of any construction. It looks like no bridge has ever existed there. There must be other, hidden means of access to the tower."
msgstr "不，閣下，毫無建築的痕跡。看來這邊從來沒有橋。 這裡一定有一個祕密通道直通這座高塔。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:198
msgid ""
"Interesting... Go to my personal stores and bring me a bottle of wine. And a couple of glasses."
msgstr "有意思...去我個人收藏裡哪瓶酒來。還有酒杯。"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:203
msgid "... Glasses?"
msgstr "...酒杯？"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:207
msgid "Do it. We’ll have a guest soon."
msgstr "快去。 我們馬上就會有貴客到臨。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. "Faerie" in this paragraph is a rare, poetic word in
#. English. It is the proper name of a magical otherworld
#. associated with elves - actually, originally with
#. fairies, but before Tolkien the boundary between elves
#. and fairies was extremely blurry. In Wesnoth it is
#. deliberately unclear whether Faerie is a place that is
#. the source of magical power or a label for the inner
#. nonhuman/magical nature of the Elves. Translate freely.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:222
msgid ""
"Erlornas closed his eyes and brought his hands forward, joined palms forming a cup open to the sky. Soon they began to glow, then to flare like a brazier with the fire of Faerie, casting a cold, blue light all around the elf-lord. A wisp of light emerged from the eerie flames, and at a few murmured words from the elf-lord flew away towards the tower below. Then the light around Erlornas faded and all was seemingly as before."
msgstr ""
"爾嶁那思閉上了他的雙眼，伸出了他的雙手朝天作杯狀。 片刻之間它們開始發光，彷彿就像仙境之火在火盆裡燃燒似的發出一束陰冷的藍光包圍著精靈領主。就在精靈領主喃喃之語之間，一縷光線自怪異的火光中竄出，射入高塔之下。 於此同時圍繞著爾嶁那思身邊的光芒也已經退散了。 "

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:226
msgid "Some time later..."
msgstr "不久之後..."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:250
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "So you decided to accept the invitation. Good. Welcome, I am lord Erlornas of Wesmere. I find your presence here... surprising."
msgid ""
"So you decided to accept the invitation. Good. Welcome, I am Lord Erlornas of Wesmere. I find your presence here... surprising."
msgstr "所以你決定接受邀請，非常好。歡迎，我是韋斯彌爾的爾嶁那思領主。 我對於在這樣的場景遇到你...感到驚訝。"

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:254
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Scarcely less than I find yours, my lord elf, but I would welcome your aid against these orcs. They have been besieging my tower for weeks."
msgid ""
"Scarcely less than I find yours, my lord elf, but I would welcome your aid against these orcs. They have been besieging my tower for weeks. I dare not flee lest they chase me down."
msgstr "精靈閣下，我何嘗不是感到驚訝呢！ 但是我非常歡迎你幫助我抵禦那些半獸人。 他們已經包圍我的塔好幾個禮拜了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:258
msgid ""
"I wish their foul kind driven as far as possible from my borders, not to return. But you will explain your presence here before petitioning my aid. These lands are not of those that were appointed to man."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#. "some import" (import having identical meaning as"importance") is under-selling it; a Lich-Lord is a very serious danger.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:263
msgid ""
"My apprentices and I have come to reconnoiter, regarding a danger of some import. Perhaps you have sensed it too; black magic is in the air. A Lich-Lord of the Green Isle holds dominion in these lands."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#. The speaker is an elf, referring to a human king as "man-king" in the same way that a human might refer to an elf as an "elf-king".
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:268
msgid ""
"Preposterous. Lich-Lord Jevyan perished close to a decade ago, at the hands of your man-king."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#. This is Lich-Lord Selmar from WoF.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:273
msgid ""
"This one calls himself Selmar. In his lair, he has opened a great stone gate to the heart of the homeland of the orcs in the distant west. I probed the gateway from afar for many days, before these orcs beheld me and pursued me."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. "those whose flesh can cross a chasm as easily as can a thought cross the mind" is a poetic way of referring to Linaera's teleportation.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:278
msgid ""
"More than probed, I see you have gleaned from its secrets. Few are those whose flesh can cross a chasm as easily as can a thought cross the mind."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:282
msgid ""
"Silver magic — now I understand. So this is how these orcs have returned to trouble us. If what you speak is true, I am certain the Council would agree: this Lich-Lord must be slain and his portal quenched."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:286
msgid ""
"And what of Rualsha? The spectre of that name has haunted us ever since our first encounter with these beasts."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:290
msgid ""
"That seems an orcish name, but I do not know its owner. I have been trapped here for weeks, unable to reconnoiter nor report home."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:294
msgid ""
"Very well. Your petition for aid is granted, Linaera of the folk of Haldric. Count me as an ally and we will defeat this threat together, beginning here."
msgstr ""

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:302
msgid "New Recruits"
msgstr ""

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:303
msgid "You can now recruit Mages."
msgstr ""

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:304
msgid ""
"Both Erlornas and Linaera can recruit and recall when standing on a keep."
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:313
msgid "Defeat Gnargha"
msgstr "擊敗剛爾哈"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:317
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:228
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:467
msgid "Death of Erlornas or Linaera"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:368
msgid "And that is well ended. I stand in your debt, Erlornas of Wesmere."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. "a threeday’s march" isn't a real word, but is an archaic-sounding way to say "three days’ march
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:373
msgid ""
"Indeed. But the greater threat remains; now I, too, sense the taint of this orc-gate, scarce a threeday’s march away. We must go swiftly, across the fields."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:377
msgid ""
"I should advise against it, lord elf. Orcs have wholly taken these lands, swarming in great numbers over the plains and the hills. Traveling openly, you will surely find yourself hunted."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:381
msgid "We have warred with orcs before, madame mage."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. "skirmished" is in contrast to the previous line's "warred". A skirmish is much smaller in scale. Erlorans is saying they aren't prepared to fight huge bands of orcs.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:386
msgid ""
"We have <i>skirmished</i> with orcs. I should not be so quick to pit our merry little band against all the vastness of the north. What counsel do you tender, Linaera?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:390
msgid ""
"Near to us is a swamp, which extends some distance towards our goal. Evil things have made a nest there; foul creatures born of the lich. But orcs stay out of it, and there are firm paths on which to tread."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/04_Linaera_the_Quick.cfg:394
msgid ""
"Very well. Support from Wesmere follows close in my wake, but we cannot wait. I entrust your tower-keeper with my seal, and with directions for my kin. We make for the swamp."
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:13
msgid "A Detour through the Swamp"
msgstr "改道沼澤"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:27
msgid ""
"Leaving their wounded to mend within Linaera’s tower, the remaining elves and their human allies marched forth into the swamp. The rank stench of decay surrounded them while insects and vermin churned in the earth."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:31
msgid ""
"The forward scouts soon reported signs of undead ahead. Erlornas moved the elves into battle formations."
msgstr ""

#. [side]: type={ON_DIFFICULTY4 Necrophage Ghast Ghast Ghast}, id=leader2
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:56
msgid "Undead"
msgstr "不死族"

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:195
msgid ""
"The evil spirits who have settled in this wetland have turned it into a vile bog. I crossed here twice before by stealth, yet... this time something is changed."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:202
msgid ""
"Look! These undead are injured, decaying from neglect. Their lich master offers them no power. Where is the cruel will what first raised them from the ground?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:206
msgid ""
"Lucky for us. We can reach our destination by the western way or the northern way, though neither will be without its perils. Destroying the undead leader should also suffice, although there is little need; it seems these ones will soon crumble of their own accord."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:210
msgid ""
"Whichever path we take, we must be sure to prepare ourselves for the final battle ahead. I fear we shall have need of all the gold and experience we can gather ere we come to the gate."
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:219
msgid "Move Erlornas to the north edge of the map"
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:224
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Defeat all enemy leaders"
msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgstr "擊敗所有敵人指揮官"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:238
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Undead are resistant to physical attack. Use mages to attack the undead, and elves to protect and support the mages."
msgid ""
"Ghosts are resistant to physical attack. Use Mages to attack ghosts, and elves to protect and support the Mages."
msgstr "不死族對物理攻擊是有抵抗性的。用法師攻擊不死族，再以精靈從旁輔助與保護法師。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:290
msgid ""
"Here is the corpse of an orc. He was felled perhaps two weeks ago, and by a blade of his own kind’s make. Many more bodies lie deeper in the swamp."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:294
msgid ""
"The bodies also reek of dark magic, and the craters on this blasted land bear witness to countless spells. I think orcs fought a great battle here, against other orcs and undead. A battle for control of the gate, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:298
msgid ""
"This swamp is not far from your tower. Should your magical senses not have noticed this sooner?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:302
msgid ""
"To my inner eye the orc-gate is as a blazing inferno, bright enough to be blinding. In comparison even a mighty blast of lightning would be but a matchstick, and difficult to notice if I were not watching for it."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:306
msgid ""
"But now that I know what to look for, I feel similar magical scars all around these lands. Whatever battle this was, this swamp is not the only place it was fought. A mystery, but it bodes well for us — if there has been fighting near the gate, its defenses may already be weakened."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. Said by the enemy leader (a Ghast) as it dies.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:337
msgid "..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:372
msgid ""
"The end of our road lies close before us. Both the lich and its fell gate must be brought to ruin. The one may be done by blade, but the other is a thing wholly unknown to my folk."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:376
msgid ""
"Limited, personal teleportation notwithstanding, I grasp only the barest fragments of the gateway’s working. In truth, I suspect all the sages of man might study it for a dozen years and yet not fathom its creation."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:380
msgid ""
"But to answer your implied question: yes, I possess sufficient knowledge to undo this creation of the Lich-Lords. We must first destroy the lich, as I will require his body in order to dispel his magic."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:384
msgid ""
"You know a great deal of Lich-Lords, Linaera of the folk of Haldric. Yet you say you have studied this portal only from afar, and for but some few days?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#. Linaera is one of the Wesfolk, and formerly lived in Jevyan's Haven. After the events of TRoW the Wesfolk have joined with Haldric to found the nation of Wesnoth.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:389
msgid ""
"I mingle with the men of Haldric, lord elf, but I am not counted among their number. I am Wesfolk. I studied under Jevyan and dwelt in his Haven, ere the betrayal. That is how I learned magery, and that is also why I and not another was sent on this mission."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:393
msgid ""
"The works of this other Lich-Lord are newer to me. But with his bones, I am confident I can undo his gate. It is far easier to destroy than to create, lord elf; already you know this."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/05_A_Detour_through_the_Swamp.cfg:397
msgid ""
"Indeed. The orcs know it as well, better than any among us; their senseless destruction is... overwhelming. I fear what doom awaits Wesmere should we fail. Let us press on."
msgstr ""

#. [scenario]: id=06_Showdown
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:30
msgid "Showdown"
msgstr "攤牌"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:44
msgid ""
"Marching hard through the night, the sore wearied elves emerged from the swamp onto an arid plain. They gazed in dismay at the wasteland, strewn with refuse, boot-prints, and the broken stumps of slaughtered trees. What plants still clung to the meagre soil were blasted by cold, sandy winds."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:48
msgid ""
"Ahead, the very air hung heavy with enchantment. It grew hard to draw breath. Rumbles and tremors in the earth bore witness to the power the Lich-Lord had unleashed."
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:52
msgid ""
"The scouts soon spotted orcs ahead, only to find the creatures engaged in an unexpected work."
msgstr ""

#. [unit]: id=Rualsha, type=Orcish Sovereign
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:237
msgid "Rualsha"
msgstr "盧拉夏"

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:310
msgid ""
"—you dared resist Rualsha! You were led astray by the lich! But now you are beaten, and in defeat you see the truth. Do you swear fealty to me, and only me?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=leader5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:314
msgid "Yes, High Orc!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=helper5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:318
msgid "Yes, King Rualsha!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. WoF mentions that Lich-Lord Selmar is interested in summoning giants from the Old Continent. Giants aren't a faction in Wesnoth and probably never will be, but this is a nod to that.
#. These orcs just came from the Old Continent, so if there are giants there, these orcs would know about them.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:324
msgid ""
"Never again will orc bow to man, nor giant, nor lord of bones. Orc will only bow to orc! And who is the greatest orc of all?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=helper5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:328
msgid "You are, King Rualsha!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=leader5
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:334
msgid "My warriors obey only you!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:343
msgid "So you are Rualsha. At last we meet."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:347
msgid ""
"Raaahhh! Who dares interrupt me? Pointy ears... dainty wrists... snooty nose... you must be elves."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#. Rualsha is the "Orcish Sovereign" unit. This is a nod to that, but not crucial to keep in the translation.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:352
msgid ""
"Indeed. We elves have heard your name many times, sovereign. Yet I was unsure if I would find you here."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:356
msgid ""
"Ha! Am I not the gate-king you thought to meet? That wretched lich is dead, felled weeks ago by my hand. He brought me here to do his bidding, but in the end it was <b><i>I</i></b> who bested <b><i>him</i></b>."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. the Orcish Sovereign's portrait includes a necklace of bones
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:361
msgid ""
"Now his portal is mine; his bones my trophy! The last of his followers have sworn fealty to me, or else fallen under my blade!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:366
msgid ""
"Rualsha wears some of the lich’s bones around his neck. I must have them to dispel the gate."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:370
msgid ""
"If you think to stop me, elf, you come too late. Thousands, hundreds of thousands of orcs have already spread across the north."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. "your jewel" refers to the Ruby of Fire, which we know the orcs tried to take in LoW. But this campaign isn't about the ruby, so it's only an oblique reference.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:375
msgid ""
"The lich was weak; he dared command only a few of those who came, for fear of revolt. But I am strong, and I am orc; the hordes will gladly flock to my banner. Your jewel will be mine, your forests reduced to firewood, and your people left begging for a merciful death!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:400
msgid ""
"My lord! What is this terrible place? We have ridden hard for over a week to catch up with you."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:429
msgid ""
"I bring a weighty war-chest and the reinforcements you requested from the Ka’lian, Lord Erlornas. The council has deliberated, and sets in your hands full authority over this matter of the orcs."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. $amount will be between 150 and 75
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:441
msgid "You have gained $amount gold!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:451
msgid ""
"Fortunate is your hour of arrival, Lomarfel. I fear Rualsha’s host is too great for us to vanquish in open battle, even with your aid. But the Rangers who have come with you are skilled in stealth."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:455
msgid ""
"Even in the blasted ruins of this place, they can still pass veiled from orcish gaze, and fall upon Rualsha from behind. Once the finishing blow is struck, we will seal his portal and bring this matter to an end."
msgstr ""

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:463
msgid "Defeat Rualsha"
msgstr "擊敗盧拉夏"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:472
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Your enemy is well-defended against attacks from the south. Use rangers to sneak through the forest and mount a surprise attack from the north."
msgid ""
"Your enemy is well-defended against attacks from the south. Use rangers to sneak through the eastern forest and mount a surprise attack from the north."
msgstr "敵方對從南面的進攻有著很完善的防禦。 使用弓箭手偷偷潛入森林裡從北面發動奇襲。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:671
msgid "Aarrggh!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. A Sylph or a Shyde has just tried to fly through a magical portal, but units can only exit from the portal, not enter it. The Sylph/Shyde tok damage and was expelled from the portal. "flutter-rat" is a derogatory reference to their wings.
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:676
msgid "One way only, flutter-rat."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. Rualsha has just been attacked by an army of elves
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:702
msgid "I will have your heads!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Rualsha
#. Rualsha has just been ambushed by elves hiding in forest
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:709
msgid "Treachery! I will have your heads!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:734
msgid ""
"You may slay me, Erlornas, but my people live on. They will not forget! They will pursue you, and destroy you utterly... we will... we... arrgh..."
msgstr "爾嶁那思，你大可殺了我，但是我的人會活下。他們不會忘記！他們將會到處找你直到殺掉你為止...我們會...我們...啊..."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:746
msgid "Now is our chance, Linaera!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:779
msgid ""
"The gate... I am overwhelmed by its power! To think that even Selmar, weakest of the Lich-Lords, could sculpt a creation of this magnificence."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:783
msgid "Hurry! Destroy the foul thing before yet more orcs emerge!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:787
msgid ""
"So much Wesfolk knowledge has been lost, Erlornas. First in our flight from the Old Continent, then by our wars on the Green Isle and the deaths of our Lords. And now am I to destroy this, too: this final monument to the greatness of my once-proud people?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:791
msgid "Alas. Such is the price of our survival."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:800
msgid ""
"As the orc drew his last ragged breath, the Wesfolk mage spoke a word and cast forth her hand..."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:831
msgid "It is done."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:835
msgid ""
"We have won! The orcish warbands will scatter! In time the sands shall drink deeply of their blood."
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:839
msgid ""
"Perhaps. But I fear Rualsha spake truth. So many have already come through the gate. If hundreds of thousands of orcs have already spread across the north, how are we ever to be rid of them?"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/scenarios/06_Showdown.cfg:843
msgid ""
"Come, we must hasten from this place while the way is yet clear. We have won a first victory here, but I fear dark times will come upon its heels..."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Gateway, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/units/Gateway.cfg:4
msgid "Gateway"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Gateway, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/units/Gateway.cfg:22
msgid "A work of madness..."
msgstr ""

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/characters.cfg:20
msgid "Elves"
msgstr "精靈"

#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/characters.cfg:50
msgid "Erlornas"
msgstr "爾嶁那思"

#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/characters.cfg:64
msgid "Linaera"
msgstr "萊鈉艾爾"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:20
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "啊..."

#. [message]: speaker=Urugha
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:24
msgid "Finally! Got him!"
msgstr "終於！抓住他！"

#. [message]: race=elf
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:31
msgid "Lord!"
msgstr "閣下！"

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:35
msgid "Take... command... Drive them... away."
msgstr "接下...指揮權... 擊退...他們."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:42
msgid ""
"Lord Erlornas died the day he first fought the orcs and never saw the end of the war. Given its final outcome, this was perhaps for the best."
msgstr "很不幸的爾嶁那思領主在戰役開始的第一天就戰死沙場，也意味著他永遠見不到戰役結束的那一天。 以最後的結果而論，這也許對他來說是最好的結局。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:59
msgid "Ha! Me smashed da funny elf. Me got a trophy!"
msgstr "哈！我打倒了一個好笑的精靈。我得到了一個戰利品！"

#. [message]: role=advisor
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:63
msgid "No! This can’t be!"
msgstr "不！ 這是不可能的！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:68
msgid ""
"Soon after Erlornas died, the elven party, lacking a leader and pressed from all sides, scattered and fled. Their retreat to Wesmere was arduous and long."
msgstr "爾嶁那思死後不久，群龍無首的精靈部隊被來自四面八方的敵人衝散開來了。撤退到韋斯彌爾的路既漫長又艱難。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:72
msgid ""
"During their retreat, the pass was crossed by another army moving in the opposite direction. Orcs were back south of the pass, and this time they were to stay for a long, long time."
msgstr "在精靈們撤退的途中，另外一個半獸人軍團正從反方向而來。半獸人回到南方的通道，而這次他們可不會輕易的離開。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:89
msgid ""
"Lord Erlornas never saw the blade that felled him. He died on the spot, with not a chance to issue last commands or farewells. Without him his wardens soon fell into confusion, and losing heart withdrew from the battle."
msgstr ""
"爾嶁那思領主連兇手是誰沒看到就被殺死了。當場斃命的他，來不及下達最後一道命令或是遺言。 群龍無首的精靈衛士們馬上陷入恐慌，就此無心戀戰並撤離了戰場。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:94
msgid ""
"When reinforcements finally arrived, elves managed to dislodge the orcish tribe. But the threat from the north remained unresolved and loomed large over their future."
msgstr "當救兵終於抵達，精靈們一股作氣把半獸人族趕走。 但是來自北方的威脅並沒有解除，令他們的未來蒙上一層陰影。"

#. [message]: speaker=Linaera
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:114
msgid "Alas, Erlornas, I have failed us..."
msgstr "啊，爾嶁那思，我辜負了大家..."

#. [message]: speaker=Erlornas
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:120
msgid "All is lost! Without Linaera’s help, I cannot hope to succeed!"
msgstr ""

#. [message]: speaker=Lomarfel
#: data/campaigns/An_Orcish_Incursion/utils/deaths.cfg:138
msgid "Erlornas, you must defeat Rualsha! I have given my all..."
msgstr ""
